;    5: TDecorate(count=6, unk2=13464750, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    6: TDecorate(count=9, unk2=6413008, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    7: TDecorate(count=42, unk2=16755370, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    8: TDecorate(count=35, unk2=255, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    9: TDecorate(count=2, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=だま, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   10: TDecorate(count=5, unk2=8388863, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   11: TDecorate(count=9, unk2=16776960, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
; Display conditions:
;    0: TWdCondition(count=2377, target=)
; Links:
;    0: TWdLink(count=2142, event=, unk3=)
;---------------------------------------
; BEGIN DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------
<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\すきま風の声.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\蔵焼け跡.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "T" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>The dusty, musty storehouse had turned into a giant box that reeked of char.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The first floor hadn't burned. As expected, the second floor was badly burned out.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The area around the books had burned especially badly.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Someone had set fire to the books directly.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Chiga-nee's</STYLE> memo and the many books had burned, and <STYLE ID="1">Chiga-nee's</STYLE> phone was no longer usable either.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If I'd known this would happen, I'd have taken pictures.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Now <STYLE ID="1">Chiga-nee's</STYLE> information remains only in my memory.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Eri-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, I walked </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Natsumi-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> back."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Thanks. How was she?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"She was scared, like we thought..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"I see..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Kogori-senpai's</STYLE> nerves must be close to their limit by now.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Maybe I should call off today's search and go back to the room too...
{CREATECG "リファレンス解禁画像" "グラフィック\システム\リファレンス解禁画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "265" "600" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Do you think they'll hold the thirteenth-year memorial service tomorrow?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Hmm, not sure... I think </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Grandma</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> will probably decide tomorrow morning."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A disappearance, a fire, the trees gone wrong―everything really does make you think of the end of the world.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I feel bad for <STYLE ID="6">Niimura-senpai's father</STYLE>, but this is no time to be holding the thirteenth-year memorial service...<PG>
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="7">Niimura-senpai</STYLE>...?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\鬱蒼.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
No, wait a minute―what about <STYLE ID="7">Niimura-senpai</STYLE> and Obasan!?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No matter how you look at it, they're way too late getting back...!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It's been more than two hours since they set out.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\スマフォ黄ストラップ切.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "650" "C" "100" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯押す.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\スマフォ黄ストラップ入.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "100" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
There was no reply on my phone either.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I tried calling, but again there was no answer.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Has something gone wrong after all?<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "アイテム1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">! Where's the cave </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> went to!? Show me!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Where </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Haruka-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> went? Now that you mention it, she's way too late getting back...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Right!? Something must have happened, don't you think!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"G-got it! Let's hurry!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Wait! We're taking </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> too! Go get her, please!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Y-yes!"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1,000" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
There are two reasons for taking <STYLE ID="4">Kogori-senpai</STYLE> along.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
One is so that <STYLE ID="4">Kogori-senpai</STYLE> isn't left alone any longer.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And the other is to use her as a feint against <STYLE ID="8">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If <STYLE ID="8">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE> is hijacking <STYLE ID="4">Kogori-senpai's</STYLE> five senses, then this way <STYLE ID="8">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE> can be <STYLE ID="9" RUBY="だま">deceived</STYLE> too.<PG>
Besides, <STYLE ID="7">Niimura-senpai</STYLE> went looking for the mummy, and <STYLE ID="8">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE> should know that too.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If we're heading to the same place, there's no point hiding it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It's no different from keeping <STYLE ID="4">Kogori-senpai</STYLE> <STYLE ID="9" RUBY="だま">deceived</STYLE>, but it can't be helped.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家夜.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Eri-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">! I brought her!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, you're letting me help too!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Yes! We're going to search for </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> and Obasan!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Then just </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> and I will go there!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">　</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, shouldn't you be looking into the storehouse!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Senpai</STYLE>...! Making unnecessary suggestions at a time like this...!<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"No! We have to go, all three of us...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Natsumi-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">! Right now you should do what </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Eri-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> says!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"O-okay..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Nice follow-up, <STYLE ID="2">Kana-chan</STYLE>!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In that case, no time like the present. We have to get to that underground place quickly.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\荒田枯れ木.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1,人物2" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"It's about 10 minutes into this forest."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"The trees are almost all dead..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"They weren't like this a little while ago..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, this is apparently the work of </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Necro</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">―</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, a fungus that covers this whole area. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">It seems to strip this mountain of its nutrients, root and all."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">...?"</STYLE><PG>
That's as much information as I can give <STYLE ID="4">Kogori-senpai</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I can't tell her yet about the Fierce Sound, or about the disguise as cherry trees.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'll tell her only about the ecology, to clear up at least some of <STYLE ID="4">Kogori-senpai's</STYLE> questions, and keep <STYLE ID="8">Shigatsu Youka's</STYLE> purpose to myself.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Of course, I can't mention the sense-hijacking either.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'll give <STYLE ID="4">Kogori-senpai</STYLE> information right up to the line, and no further.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This also serves to mislead <STYLE ID="8">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE> about where the limit of what we know lies.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜手前バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Wait!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Suddenly <STYLE ID="2">Kana-chan</STYLE> stepped in front of us.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Then, holding her breath, she watched our surroundings intently.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ考えるバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"What's wrong?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<STYLE ID="2">"Quiet... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Someone's there."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Could it be </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
With that, <STYLE ID="2">Kana-chan</STYLE> took a knife in each hand.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\ナイフを構える.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜ナイフ1.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Who's there!? You're there, aren't you!? Come out!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
When <STYLE ID="2">Kana-chan</STYLE>, knives raised, shouted at the top of her voice―<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\竹林黒霧.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\死神\死神軍団武器.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物2" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
From behind trees and out of the dead grass, people in Noh masks and red robes crept into view.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The big moon in the sky lit the nata and maces in their hands.<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"What? These people..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Probably people from the settlement..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Residents of the Arata settlement...!? What? What's with these creepy outfits...!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No, these outfits―<PG>
These are the Noh masks and red robes, the nata and the maces that <STYLE ID="10">Sakura-san</STYLE> sent <STYLE ID="11">Niimura-senpai's mother</STYLE> 10 years ago.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Add Droga, and you have everything used in the Megasawa City case.<PG>
"<STYLE ID="2">Kana</STYLE>. Our guests. Turn back at once. You must not go beyond this point."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Move! I have to find </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Haruka-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The residents showed no sign of flinching, even at <STYLE ID="2">Kana-chan's</STYLE> menace.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Athletic or not, a little kid like <STYLE ID="2">Kana-chan</STYLE> taking on adults is reckless...!<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Eri-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">! </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Natsumi-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">! Get behind me!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But we weren't any more used to this kind of situation than <STYLE ID="2">Kana-chan</STYLE> was.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I pulled <STYLE ID="4">Kogori-senpai</STYLE> by the arm and stepped back behind <STYLE ID="2">Kana-chan</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What are these people after?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If we back off, will they leave us alone?<PG>
But <STYLE ID="7">Niimura-senpai</STYLE> and Obasan should be somewhere up ahead.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If these people have done something to <STYLE ID="7">Niimura-senpai</STYLE> or <STYLE ID="1">Chiga-nee</STYLE>...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This settlement really isn't of one mind.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The fire just now, too. Burning that can't be read as the residents' united will.<PG>
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\山の中.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Mm... Everyone, wait!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
A shout I recognized came from a different direction than the residents.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\茅萱ナイフ血.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Sis</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"............ </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">Who's that?"</STYLE>
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
;---------------------------------------
; END DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------